# Maelstrom Pulse's DestroyAll reads ValidCards$ TargetedCard.Self,Permanent.
# NotDefinedTargeted+sharesNameWith Targeted through
# AbilityUtils.filterListByType (:836-852): the targeted Grizzly Bears is the
# source, NotDefinedTargeted (CardProperty.java:2067-2071) leaves it to the
# first alternative, and the other Grizzly Bears shares its name: both are
# destroyed, Pacifism follows. L2: same as Java.
startturn human
advance 3
queue paygeneric B
queue targets 50
queue cardorder 50,54
tapformana human 100 B
tapformana human 101 B
tapformana human 102 G
castspell human 1
resolvestack
